&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong, hands-on coder. Python and one of Java/Go/TypeScript. Production-grade code, not prototypes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
