&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Can explain a complex system to a non-technical merchant lead. Turns vague asks into clear specs. Owns problems end-to-end without being told.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
