rif;&quot;&gt;• Identify upsell and cross-sell opportunities within existing bank relationships (e.g., adding new benefit categories, Audience Intelligence, Ads/Media Network, or new card variants).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Own target sourcing lists and outreach cadence across banks, fintechs, and loyalty players deal &amp;amp; Relationship Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Serve as the senior Razorpay point of contact for assigned bank partners through the deal lifecycle, from first pitch to commercial go-live.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Negotiate commercial terms, pricing, and contractual scope in coordination with Legal, Finance, and Product.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Coordinate internally with Product, Engineering, Compliance, and Finance to convert a signed deal into a live, revenue-generating program Farming (light-touch, ~10%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Provide senior oversight on select escalations or renewal conversations where a commercial decision is required; day-to-day servicing, MIS, and reconciliation stay with Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;• 5–8 years of experience in BFSI sales, bank/NBFC partnerships, card network alliances, or fintech business development, with a demonstrable track record of hunting and closing new B2B/B2B2C deals with banks or financial institutions&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;• Strong commercial acumen — comfortable building P&amp;amp;Ls, pricing models, and business cases to pitch to bank stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Prior exposure to loyalty/rewards, co-brand cards, gift cards, payments, or banking ecosystems is strongly preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Excellent stakeholder management and negotiation skills — able to operate confidently with senior bank decision-makers (VP/AVP and above).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Comfortable working cross-functionally with Product, Legal, Finance, and Engineering to take a deal from pitch to go-live.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Self-starter with a bias for outbound hunting activity, not just responding to inbound demand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Why Join&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Own a high-visibility, revenue-generating mandate at the intersection of banking, payments, and loyalty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Work directly with marquee banking partners on flagship programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;• Clear path to Senior Manager / Associate Director for strong performers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3a65a3c2-7fff-88ff-9e94-8ab11a050d04&quot;&gt;Razorpay believes in and follows an equal employment opportunity policy that doesn&#39;t discriminate on gender, religion, sexual orientation, colour, nationality, age, etc. We welcome interests and applications from all groups and communities across the globe. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
