&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;3. Build Scalable Products - Collaborate with engineering, design, analytics, and operations teams to build reliable, scalable, and high-impact products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;4. Lead Product Execution - Write high-quality product specifications, prioritize effectively, manage tradeoffs, and ensure timely execution across releases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;5. Own Metrics &amp;amp; Outcomes - Define success metrics, monitor business impact, and driveiterative improvements through experimentation and data analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
