&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;End-to-End Ownership of Merchant Issues:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle complex or high-value merchant concerns, ensuring timely and satisfactory resolution with minimal follow-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalation Management:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of L2/L3 escalations, coordinate with cross-functional teams (Product, Risk, Tech, FinOps), and ensure root cause identification and resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workflow Optimization &amp;amp; SOP Design:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
