&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Business Performance &amp;amp; OKRs: Define and monitor annual and quarterly OKRs across business units.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
